      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get what u mean about the stairs but i really dont think its my heart. i'm 58 but i eat pretty healthy and i don't have high blood pressure or anything. plus it literally feels exactly like the burn i get after a spicy meal. i just want to avoid a long trip to the clinic if i can help it. if i just took a higher dose of Pepcid once or twice to see if it kills the feeling, would that be okay? or like maybe some of those liquid antacids that work faster?",
